                <table cols="3" rows="3">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell rendition="#top">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Notes</hi>:</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#top">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>.</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#top">Total R.A.F. strength
                            is figured as follows: Number of squadrons × authorized strength plus
                            50% reserve. There is not a definite figure set as a reserve but 50% is
                            known to be very conservative as far as fighters are concerned.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell rendition="#top">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>.</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#top">It is contemplated that the number of U.S. planes
                            will be reduced 365 by Jan. 1944 if proposed planning is carried
                            out.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell rendition="#top">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#top">Reductions or additions in R.A.F. strength not included.</cell>
